{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1183393-five-become-one-a-short-story-fan-made","id":1183393,"title":"Five Become One: A Short Story (Fan-made)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-07T14:49:28-08:00","id":1183393,"title":"Five Become One: A Short Story (Fan-made)","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;It is five in one\u2026Anger\u2026Rage\u2026Vengence.&quot; A new, hollow voice said. </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nUnUbDcuKP9t23x_9YjV5x6mblXu93xi/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Five Become One</a> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">(click for story)</span></span></b> <hr />So this is a thing I did. It was originally intended to be a flavor piece to accompany a set of homebrew rules I'm working on (a universal cross-splat &quot;sorcery&quot; mechanic). However, I won't be having anytime to work on the mechanics in the foreseeable future, and, indeed, starting this Saturday I will be disappearing from the internet for a while, so I thought I'd throw this out as a stand-alone short story before I go.<br /> <br /> The writing, layout and artwork was done by yours truly, but (just in case this needs bold letters) <b>this is not official or endorsed by Onyx Path. </b>This is purely the product of an enthusiastic Chronicles of Darkness fan's wild imagination. I hope you enjoy it. (Feel free to leave comments. I'll be around another couple days, and I'll check back when I return.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">The longer I study science the more I am convinced that it is <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">functionally indistinguishable from what our ancestors would refer to as sorcery</span>. And I would know, being both scientist and sorcerer.</span>","edited":{"userid":23730,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","user":"Scriptorian","date":".  Changed the preview quote because I had a sudden panic attack that it read wrong out of context. 02-07-2018, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","name":"Scriptorian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23730_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}